==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Lynel Guts are [[Monster Part]]s that can be dropped by all types of [[Lynel]]s upon their defeats. They pulse with the vitality of a Lynel, which makes them useful for making [[Elixir]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Crimson Dye]] or exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]].

Several pieces of [[Armor]] require Lynel Guts to be upgraded at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].

